{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3352140/extras/cc554d59eb111dcb08b073dc2d75e649.poster.avif?t=1757436943\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3352140/extras/cc554d59eb111dcb08b073dc2d75e649.webm?t=1757436943\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3352140/extras/cc554d59eb111dcb08b073dc2d75e649.mp4?t=1757436943\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">This time, you're in for some real survival horror at a Soviet space base.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Grab your nail gun! Defend yourself from enemies. Survive. And escape from this creepy place!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3352140/extras/439947731c35e2a16163a099c2f7cda4.poster.avif?t=1757436943\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3352140/extras/439947731c35e2a16163a099c2f7cda4.webm?t=1757436943\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3352140/extras/439947731c35e2a16163a099c2f7cda4.mp4?t=1757436943\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Puzzles, keys, numerous locations, and an abundance of unpleasant enemies... We've added an incredible space atmosphere, a touch of dystopia, and a little bit of arthropodism to this classic survival horror recipe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3352140/extras/73f6223a1768cf434bfcc82be65e4330.poster.avif?t=1757436943\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3352140/extras/73f6223a1768cf434bfcc82be65e4330.webm?t=1757436943\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3352140/extras/73f6223a1768cf434bfcc82be65e4330.mp4?t=1757436943\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3352140?t=1757436943","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3352140/7a45025d5f5db85e981c49e9dcb6339d72335fa5/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757436943","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3352140/a3387907d4ee510290d71ea47affc72baee42baf/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757436943","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3352140/a3387907d4ee510290d71ea47affc72baee42baf/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757436943","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,2,5],"notes":"The game includes:\r\nDead bodies (scattered throughout the locations).\r\nProfanity (the main character occasionally uses strong language).\r\nSmoking and alcohol consumption (occurs in cutscenes).\r\nThe game includes scenes of violence and cruelty, along with instances of strong language and the consumption of alcohol or tobacco."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/st